    "stem": "<p>A CloudOps engineer manages an AWS CloudFormation template that provisions Amazon EC2 instances, an Application Load Balancer, and Amazon RDS instances. As part of an ongoing transformation project, CloudFormation stacks are being created and deleted continuously. The CloudOps engineer needs to ensure that the RDS instances continue running after a stack has been deleted.</p>\n<p>Which action should be taken to meet these requirements?</p>",
