    "answer": [
     "D"
    ],
    "why": "<p>With <code>DeletionPolicy: Retain</code>, CloudFormation leaves the RDS instances running and removes them from its management when the stack is deleted. The stack deletion completes cleanly and the rest of the resources are removed.</p>",
